      "description": "Compact task filter with the shared keyboard outline.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Tìm task<input placeholder=\"Tên công việc…\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--os-muted,#626b7c);font:400 11px var(--os-font,sans-serif)}.ds-field input{font:400 12px/1.4 var(--os-font,sans-serif);min-height:34px;border:1px solid var(--os-line-strong,#bcc3d0);border-radius:6px;background:#fff;color:var(--os-ink,#202534);padding:7px 10px;width:210px}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:#687183;opacity:1}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7250a3);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-field{display:grid;gap:4px}.ds-field input{min-height:40px;width:100%}}",
