      "description": "Populated weekly matrix cell; sample count is illustrative.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-count\" aria-label=\"Personal · 2 ghi nhận\"><b>2</b></button>",
      "css": ".ds-count{font-family:var(--os-font,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-height:34px;margin:4px 3px;padding:4px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--os-purple,#7250a3) 11%,white);color:var(--os-purple,#7250a3);cursor:pointer}.ds-count b{font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.ds-count:hover{border-color:var(--os-purple,#7250a3)}.ds-count:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7250a3);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-count{min-height:36px}}"
