      "name": "Selected day rail item",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Day selection uses pressed state, count and tint.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-day\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span>Cả tuần</span><b>—</b></button>",
      "css": ".ds-day{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:#eee7f7;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;color:#67478e;padding:10px 4px;min-width:72px;font:400 10px var(--os-font,sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-day b{font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#67478e}.ds-day:hover{background:#f2f3f7}.ds-day:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7250a3);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Agenda task row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Full wrapping title with date and status; sample content is illustrative.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-agenda\"><span class=\"ds-date\">Chưa phân ngày</span><button><strong>Kiểm tra nguồn kế hoạch tuần</strong><span>Chưa rõ</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-agenda{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #eef0f5;font-family:var(--os-font,sans-serif)}.ds-date{font-size:11px;color:var(--os-muted,#626b7c);padding:10px 0}.ds-agenda button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 0;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:0;background:none;color:var(--os-ink,#202534);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-agenda strong{flex:1;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-agenda button span{font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--os-muted,#626b7c);background:#f1f3f6;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 7px}.ds-agenda button:hover{background:#f7f5fb}.ds-agenda button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7250a3);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-agenda{grid-template-columns:43px minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;align-items:start}.ds-date{font-size:10px;padding-top:11px}.ds-agenda button{align-items:flex-start;gap:4px;flex-direction:column}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Operate",
    "overview": "Operate is a compact working environment: a light navigation frame, restrained domain color and white working surfaces on a cool canvas. Information density comes from aligned rows, short headings and clear separators. Weekly work, priorities and source status lead the home surface; the calendar exposes full task titles in grouped rows.\n\nThis records the implemented shared layer in apps/personal-os-v1/executive.css, with the home composition in workspaces.mjs and calendar behavior in calendar.mjs. The existing orbital logo remains the visual origin and must remain byte for byte unchanged. Every domain, menu item, route, source record and permission remains intact.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Light global bar and sidebar",
      "Self hosted Noto Sans with Vietnamese support",
      "Restrained purple, jade, bronze and indigo accents",
      "Compact inline pulse, weekly matrix and priorities",
      "Grouped full width calendar rows with a day rail"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Quiet Frame",
        "body": "Keep the navigation frame light; reserve domain accents for selected navigation, actions and small data markers.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Source Before Certainty",
        "body": "Keep missing dates and source caveats visible; task counts are not completion percentages.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the original logo bytes, every domain, menu item, route, permission and source record.",
      "Do use the shared domain accent, Noto Sans, compact headings and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do keep source caveats, missing data, uncertainty and actual completion semantics visible.",
      "Do preserve dense-view scrolling and access to complete task details on phones.",
      "Do verify inherited module layouts in a browser before claiming universal visual consistency."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add slogans, oversized headers, display serif typography or decorative prose panels.",
      "Don't invent revenue, completion percentages, business claims or source evidence.",
      "Don't redraw, recolor, filter or decorate the orbital logo.",
      "Don't change native chart geometry, domain structure, menu labels or navigation contracts during visual work.",
      "Don't describe source inspection as rendered QA or claim screenshots that were not captured."
    ]
  }
}
